                ['Tamil Nadu (2021)', 'Cross subsidy charge at 60% of conventional for wind and 70% for solar, for third-party open access', 'Electricity tax subsidy 100% for 5 years', 'Open access charges at 50% of conventional; dual grid at 50 MW or more; additional feeder above 100 MW'],
