            p('Units get a 100% electricity duty exemption for 10 years. Transmission and wheeling charges are exempted for 25 years from commissioning: 50% on intra-state purchase, 75% on renewable power from within the state, and 100% of intra-state charges on inter-state purchase, for the first eight parks or an added 2 GW. Parks get the dual-grid subsidy, and the policy aims for at least 50% renewable energy in new data centres by 2030.', 'up26-pdf'),
            p('Incentives do not create grid capacity. A park still needs a connection the distribution company or transmission utility can deliver on its date.'),
            links('Power in detail', [(PAGES['power-for-data-centres-india'], 'power-for-data-centres-india'), (PAGES['data-centre-grid-connection-india'], 'data-centre-grid-connection-india')]),
