            p('The 2022 amendment raised the targets to 900 MW, ₹30,000 crore and at least eight parks. The 2026 policy repeals the 2021 policy and its amendment; entities holding a Letter of Comfort under it that have partly or fully availed incentives remain eligible for the admissible benefits.', 'up22-amd', 'up26-pdf'),
