    'Karnataka’s cabinet approved a Sustainable Data Centre Policy 2026-31 in September 2026: ₹1,300.45 crore budget, 1 GW target, PUE incentive up to ₹20 crore and parks at Hoskote, Mangaluru and Mysuru.',
    'Karnataka, India',
