                'Treated water reimbursement up to ₹8 lakh a year for five years.',
                'R&D support of 50% up to ₹15 crore.',
                'Custom packages for projects above ₹3,000 crore, including cable landing stations, subsea data centres and desalination.',
                'Registration through KITS and the Karnataka Udyoga Mitra single window.',
