            p('Bengaluru had 162 MW operational in 17 data centres in mid-2026, mostly in peripheral east Bengaluru around Whitefield, with colocation vacancy of 28%. Cushman & Wakefield reports plans for a 500 MW park near Hoskote by 2031 and 500 MW at Mysuru and Mangaluru.', 'cw-h126'),
